Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a selective median over the 5 most consistent models (pool1) to see if a more focused median beats the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Try a selective median over pool2 to see if a tighter pool improves over current median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full model set to see if trimming improves over the current median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the dba combination on the largest consistent pool (pool3) to see if it improves over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a selective median over the largest consistent pool (pool3) to see if it improves on the current median baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Evaluate a DBA combination on the smaller, more consistent pool1 to see if the selective weighting improves over the current median pool3 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a selective dba on the slightly larger pool2 to see if it beats the current median pool3 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse-error weights on pool3 to see if it beats the current median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing inverse_error handle but on the full pool to see if expanding the pool helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w2"}

Thought: Try the best single ETS model to see if a single simple model outperforms the current median pool3 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full model pool to see if a learned meta-weighting improves over the current median pool3 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error weighting directly to see if the narrower pool improves over the current median leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

